        "payload": "tree 2401d4432da66fb1431ccc2e8d06deb6958d2e8e\nparent ddea9196493d3b8fd841a36a6c53efd85dac7a05\nauthor yuvicc <yuvichh01@gmail.com> 1793771976 +0530\ncommitter yuvicc <yuvichh01@gmail.com> 1793771976 +0530\n\ntest: construct multisig_tests inputs/outputs declaratively\n\nReplace the field-by-field construction of the inputs and outputs in\nmultisig_verify and multisig_Sign with COutPoint, CTxIn and CTxOut\nconstructor calls.\n\nThe funding outputs were previously created by vout.resize(3) and only\nhad their scriptPubKey assigned, leaving nValue null (-1). The -1 is\nnow spelled out explicitly so the transactions are unchanged.\n\nThe loop index is changed to uint32_t to match COutPoint::n, as\nbrace-initialization does not allow the narrowing conversion from int.\n",
